{"duration_api_ms":210198,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5de8ecc5-0616-4fc3-8660-61095bda3c6d","total_cost_usd":0.243758,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12126,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":19525,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13819},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12126,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":19525,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12126},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":19525,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12126,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.243758,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":13819,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"Feasible front has only 2 points (C-a129e2c3933f, C-bbf9cdb0a525), both at the corner D~3.1-3.3, bluntness 1.2, cone 69.9. Reference spans (2.5e6 W/m2, 150 K of bondline temperature), so a 1 K drop in T is worth about 5x more hypervolume than the flux changes reachable here. Improvement must come from lowering bondline T while keeping max_g < 12 (limit inferred from margins) and mass margin >= 0. 14 of 40 evaluations returned no geometry. Failures cluster at bluntness >= 1.25 with cone <= 69.9, and at low cone angles for their bluntness.\",\"evidence\":[\"max_g limit is 12: C-a129e2c3933f g=11.055, margin 0.0787. At D~3.0-3.3, g rises about 1.5-1.7 per deg of |gamma|: C-1e7b6fd1901c gamma -3.6 g=11.886 (margin 0.009), C-602600f85327 gamma -4.2 g=13.0 (infeasible). g depends only weakly on D (about +0.35 per m).\",\"Bondline T falls with steeper gamma at fixed geometry, about 8-12 K/deg: C-602600f85327 (D3.2, gamma -4.2) 388.6 K vs C-a129e2c3933f (D3.3, gamma -3.0) 398.6 K. Shallow gamma is worse: C-eae9b8e0689a gamma -2.2 is 418 K.\",\"Larger bluntness and cone lower T and flux at fixed D and gamma: C-8fd56d301a14 (b0.6, cone 45) 413.5 K/411k; C-b5d3475ab118 (b0.9, cone 62) 407.4 K; C-c12000ea6fcb (b1.0, cone 66.3) 406.4 K; C-5bc1f1f05670 (b1.1, cone 69.9, gamma -3.2) 403.1 K.\",\"Mass-fraction margin depends on D and slightly on b/cone, not on gamma: D3.1 0.161 (C-bbf9cdb0a525), D3.2 0.106 (C-602600f85327), D3.3 0.0497 (C-a129e2c3933f), about -0.055 per 0.1 m. It hits zero near D~3.39. C-c97855c2d790 (D4.27) is -0.83.\",\"Bluntness 1.25 (C-a554636d8035) fails the cd_fore convex-hull check. Bluntness 1.3 (C-ed967979f72a) gives an invalid geometry. Bluntness 1.2 at cone 69.9 is valid at D3.1-3.3 (C-a129e2c3933f, C-bbf9cdb0a525, C-602600f85327), and geometry validity looks independent of D since all lengths scale with D.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies partly on prior Allen-Eggers-type scaling, calibrated to the data above. Stagnation flux scales about as sqrt(sin(gamma)/(Rn*CdA)), so larger D and bluntness lower flux, and shallower gamma lowers flux too. Bondline T follows the integrated heat load, which falls with larger nose radius, larger area (lower ballistic coefficient) and steeper gamma (shorter pulse). Steeper gamma costs peak deceleration g, capped at 12. D is capped by the heatshield mass fraction near 3.38. So the T-optimal region is max b/cone, D~3.3-3.38, and gamma near the g=12 boundary (about -3.55 to -3.6). Shallower-gamma variants at the same geometry extend the front toward lower flux with higher T.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The g boundary is tight: predicted g at gamma -3.55 to -3.6 is 11.9-12.0, so some of these will probably be infeasible. The mass-fraction edge near D3.37-3.38 is extrapolated linearly. The sqrt(sin gamma) flux scaling is approximate, and the C-602600f85327 point suggests flux may be about 3-5% lower than the scaling predicts. T-vs-gamma slope is about 8 K/deg near -3.5 but 12+ K/deg at shallow angles. Whether bluntness 1.22 at cone 70.0 passes the hull check is unknown. Effects of cone 70.0 vs 69.9 are unknown.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Same corner design as the best front point, gamma steepened to -3.55 to push T down while keeping g just under 12.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the g=12 boundary at D3.3 and gives a likely T improvement over 398.6 K.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly larger D (mass margin about 0.02 expected) with gamma -3.5: both lower flux and lower T than the current front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":283000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the D gain outweighs the shrinking mass margin, and the g increase from D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.35 at moderate gamma -3.3 gives a comfortable-g point between the current front and the boundary.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":275000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front between the 270k/398.6 K point and the g-limited points with a safe-margin design.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Only D changed to 3.35 at gamma -3.0, to isolate the D effect and check the mass margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Clean D-sensitivity measurement at the low-flux end and mass margin check at 3.35.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.37 is near the mass-fraction edge (about 0.01 margin predicted) with gamma -3.45, seeking the lowest T that stays feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the mass-fraction limit and the largest usable D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.3 at gamma -3.4 for the T-vs-gamma curve at the corner design.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":282000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"A safe point on the T-gamma curve, about 0.3 g below the limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.3 at gamma -3.25, a small step steeper than the current best.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":276000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds coverage in the flux 270-285k band with a small T gain.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Shallower gamma -2.7 lowers flux at the cost of higher T, extending the front toward low flux.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":257000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends front coverage on the low-flux side; g is comfortably below the limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.35 with shallow gamma -2.4 targets a much lower flux end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests how far flux can be reduced while T stays well under 450 K.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Even shallower gamma -2.2 at D3.35, to map the low-flux tail.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks flux scaling with sin(gamma) and gives a non-dominated low-flux point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Cone angle 70.0 (upper bound) instead of 69.9, gamma -3.5, to see if the cone edge helps Cd and T.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":287000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the last 0.1 deg of cone gives any benefit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Probe bluntness 1.22 with cone 70.0; the hull limit lies between 1.2 and 1.25 and larger nose radius lowers flux and T.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.22,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":278000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Maps the bluntness boundary of the valid/hull region; a failure is informative too.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-602600f85327\",\"rationale\":\"D3.2 at gamma -3.6 (the parent is the gamma -4.2 g-violator): a lower mass-fraction, near-g-limit design.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":295000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the g limit near gamma -3.6 at D3.2 and gives a T close to the best guess with mass margin about 0.1.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.38 with gamma -3.2 sits at the mass-fraction edge to check how far D can grow.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gives the low-flux/low-T combination if the mass margin holds; otherwise identifies the D limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Aggressive point near the g boundary: D3.33, gamma -3.58, predicted g about 11.97.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.33,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the lowest feasible T on the g=12 boundary at large D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bbf9cdb0a525\",\"rationale\":\"D3.25 with gamma -3.55, between the two existing front points, with a bit more mass margin than D3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.25,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":292500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills in the D dimension near the g boundary for a fit of T(D, gamma).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly lower bluntness (1.1) at D3.35 and gamma -3.5 to quantify the b sensitivity at large D and get a diverse front point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.1,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":294000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Separates the bluntness effect from D and gamma effects and checks that a 1.1 bluntness is valid at the mass edge.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"Bluntness 1.15 at gamma -3.5 to measure the b gradient near the corner and check for robust geometry.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.15,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":292000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Local sensitivity of flux and T to bluntness at the best D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.3 at gamma -3.45, filling the gamma sweep between -3.4 and -3.55.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":284000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Dense sampling of the T-gamma-g relationship close to the constraint edge.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a129e2c3933f\",\"rationale\":\"D3.3 at gamma -3.2, a mild step steeper than the parent.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Anchors the low-gamma side of the T(gamma) curve at the corner geometry.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":162963,"type":"result","duration_ms":210275,"uuid":"9457979e-ee29-4af4-8448-8753e519c923","ttft_stream_ms":1557,"time_to_request_ms":74,"first_content_frame_ms":1558,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
